# Opportunity Radar — environment template
# Copy to .env (never commit .env). All values below are OPTIONAL for the demo MVP:
# the app runs fully on local seed data with none of these set.

# --- Authentication (not yet wired; see src/auth/authAdapter.ts) ---
# Chosen provider is a founder decision. Placeholders for the leading candidates:
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# --- Billing (not yet wired; see docs/OPPORTUNITY_RADAR_MVP.md "Stripe plan") ---
# Publishable key only — secret keys belong in serverless functions, never in Vite env.
# VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# --- Future live-data API (not yet built) ---
# VITE_RADAR_API_BASE_URL=
